==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|es|la|incendere}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|incendō}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|incense}}.

===Verb===
{{es-verb|encend|er|pres=enciendo}}

# to [[light]], to [[ignite]]
#: ''Julio encendió la [[fogata]].'' Julio ignited the campfire.
# to [[turn on]], to [[switch on]], to [[power up]]
#: ''María encendió la máquina.'' María turned on the machine.

